  "goodToKnow": "Der Schädling is a pest, insects, rodents or fungi that harm crops, forests or homes. After the dry summers from 2018, der Borkenkäfer (bark beetle) destroyed huge areas of spruce forest, especially in the Harz. Die Schädlingsbekämpfung is pest control, and der Kammerjäger an exterminator. The opposite is der Nützling (beneficial creature like ladybirds). Plural: die Schädlinge."
